text It's raining as I go to the shopping arcade.
text Gray clouds cover the sky.
text The humid air darkens the store windows and the trees lining the street.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I should've brought an umbrella.)
text I noticed the rain when I set out, but kept going anyway because I didn't feel like going back.
text Just as I'm about to go into a store to avoid getting wet, something happens.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
text I see a familiar face walking down the opposite side of the street.
text It's the mistress of the library, Kotomi Ichinose.
text This might be the first time I've seen her outside of school.
text Not noticing me, she enters a bookstore alone.
if intF[403] == 1
	goto 27
fi
