text The automatic doors open and I hear soothing music playing.
text It's been a while since I've been to a bookstore.
text I have time to kill anyway.
text Something about her is bugging me.
text I hope she isn't planning what I think she is...
text I glance around the partially crowded store.
text There she is.
text She's standing in front of a shelf full of complex books.
text She starts reading one.
text As usual, her reading speed is insane.
text Suddenly, her fingers stop turning the pages.
text She's lost in thought.
text Then she takes out a pair of scissors.
text Just as I thought.
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you serious?!
