	fi
fi
sound BU0.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text They'll get mad if you send something living.
text @[Tomoya]
text So it's okay to send something dead?
sound BU1.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I don't think that's the point.
sound BU2.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text You'd have to cut it up into small pieces and box it up...
text @[Tomoya]
text In that case, what would you put in the description?
sound BU3.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Dismembered corpse.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text Someone, please call the police.
text @[Tomoya]
text I mean that I'd walk you back to your house.
text I point at myself and then at her, trying to explain each part of my sentence.
text @[Tomoya]
text I won't be using the postal service or cutting you up.
text @[Tomoya]
text I mean that I'll accompany you back home.
text @[Tomoya]
text And since I don't have an umbrella, we'll have to share yours.
text I feel like I'm saying something really embarrassing, but I don't care anymore.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is your house close enough that I can walk you back?
